# Branch before changes

Before starting any implementation work:

1. `git fetch origin` and update onto the latest integration branch for this repo.
2. Create and check out a new branch with a meaningful name (`feature/…`, `fix/…`, `chore/…`).
3. Only then edit files and commit on that branch.

Do not commit feature work directly on `main` / default branch unless the user explicitly asks.
